{"id":"bc2c3fb445fcd280","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-gl-axiom-k.md","title":"GL Axiom K","display":"df-gl-axiom-k — GL Axiom K","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-gl-axiom-k","aliases":["89-df-gl-axiom-k"],"display":"df-gl-axiom-k — GL Axiom K","depends_on":["[[89-df-k-axiom]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-gl-axiom-k"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-gl-axiom-k</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-gl-axiom-k — GL Axiom K"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97dd3729fefd2e30\" href=\"?note=97dd3729fefd2e30\" title=\"89-df-k-axiom\">89-df-k-axiom</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}k}\\vdash\nK^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{A}_{K}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}k}\\vdash\nK^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{A}_{K}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K^{\\star}\">\\(K^{\\star}\\)</span> 是本章对 K 公理模式的别名。</li>\n<li>K公理保证可证明性的分配性</li>\n<li>K公理是所有正常模态逻辑的公理</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-k-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-k-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-k-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"97dd3729fefd2e30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-k-axiom]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{A}_{K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gl\\text{-}axiom\\text{-}k}\\vdash\nK^{\\star}\\coloneqq\\mathcal{A}_{K}.","display":true},{"tex":"K^{\\star}","display":false}],"bytes":590,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-axiom-k]]"}],"outgoing":["97dd3729fefd2e30"]}